1
00:00:00,568 --> 00:00:04,398
(Sheldon:)Four hours more and we would have
closed down the HomeTown Buffet.

2
00:00:05,173 --> 00:00:07,373
- I thought you had plans with Amy.
- Yeah, I did.

3
00:00:07,542 --> 00:00:10,872
(Sheldon:)But then Wil called Amy a pain in the A-S-S.

4
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,080
(Sheldon:)She got huffy and left,
and then Wil and I headed out to dinner.

5
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:19,120
(Sheldon:)That place really did remind me
of my hometown.

6
00:00:19,287 --> 00:00:21,777
(Sheldon:)Because there we also have
a HomeTown Buffet.

7
00:00:24,225 --> 00:00:28,385
- Hold on. Wil and Amy had an argument?
- Yes, quite the kerfuffle.

8
00:00:28,563 --> 00:00:32,333
- Then Amy got mad and left?
- Walked right out the door.

9
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,060
(Leonard:)And you?

10
00:00:34,235 --> 00:00:36,895
(Sheldon:)Enjoyed a delightful dinner
at a reasonable price.

11
00:00:38,139 --> 00:00:42,739
(Sheldon:)The manager recognized Wil and let us sit
right next to the frozen-yogurt machine.

12
00:00:42,911 --> 00:00:44,211
(Sheldon:)Right next to it.

13
00:00:44,712 --> 00:00:47,742
(Sheldon:)I was closer to it than I am to you right now.

14
00:00:50,084 --> 00:00:53,684
- Buddy, I think Amy might be upset.
- Why's that?

15
00:00:53,855 --> 00:00:57,415
(Leonard:)Because your friend was rude to her
and then you went to dinner with him.

16
00:00:57,959 --> 00:01:00,589
(Sheldon:)You're just repeating what I said.

